  "statuteText": "659:76 Return From Unincorporated Place. –\n\nAs provided in RSA 668:7, the town clerk shall prepare and forward a return of the votes cast in his town by voters of unincorporated places, if any, in the same manner as provided in RSA 659:71-75."
